    "text": "All possible numbers are formed using the digits <math><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>4</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math> taken all at a time. The number of such numbers in which the odd digits occupy even places is"
